  "summary": "Art and culture of the Tang Dynasty ( 唐朝 , 618–907) thrived in the prosperous Kaiyuan period.",
  "description": "Art and culture of the Tang Dynasty ( 唐朝 , 618–907) thrived in the prosperous Kaiyuan period. It features grace, grandeur, openness and inclusiveness with a powerful presence, mixing ethnic customs and Central Plains culture. It values plump beauty, gorgeous designs and the vibrant spirit of a prosperous era.",
